
# Humanin Analysis Module

This directory contains computational code related to the analysis of the
Humanin micropeptide.

The Humanin-related analyses are organized into three independent modules:

- Protein–peptide docking using HDOCKlite
- Sequence-based physicochemical characterization
- Post-docking binding free energy estimation using PRODIGY

Only code is provided in this repository. Intermediate docking outputs and
derived result files are not included to ensure clarity and compactness.
